{"title":"2005 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97d55445f7687788c7004f2024f0e8d374c1aa72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8 - 0.07$\" width=\"77\" height=\"12\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a984d8394b10b753694dc418fb239582cc25b3a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 0.1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 0.71 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 0.793 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 0.01 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 0.73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"449\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Calculating, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d587bd24fc3e519ec2a0d51d74ff6df629765e01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8 - 0.07 = 0.80 - 0.07 = 0.73$\" width=\"244\" height=\"12\" />  The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;s